<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00365/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个由水泥浇筑成的斜坡，坡度约45度。任何物体自其底部沿坡面上升至顶部后将会获得约████倍的原速度。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>巴音郭楞蒙古自治州附近<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被整体移动至Site-CN-██异常物理学研究部门<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>是哪个白痴把全速的摩托车开上去的？要是让我找到你，实验翼区的全部重建费用必从你工资里扣。</em>——Dr.Kleiner</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00365" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00365" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00365-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5232386&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606616538" alt="Kayo_Kesr_Aquas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5232386)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kayo-kesr-aquas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5232386); return false;">Kayo_Kesr_Aquas</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597821914 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">19 Aug 2020 07:25</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一行带有模因的文字，会使观察者产生极度反感并拒绝记忆位于与项目之前的内容。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>各类书籍<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>未被完全收容<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">以下为一个典型范例</a></div>
