<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<h3><span>要求全文背诵</span></h3>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00335" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00335" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00335-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606616538" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
